
== microsoft-az-204
   pay : $133,080 median for software developers (BLS, May 2024) — but AZ-204 itself is no longer obtainable
   pass: No official pass rate was ever published — and now no further attempts are possible

== microsoft-ai-900
   pay : Retired exam, but the credential still counts — no salary premium on its own
   pass: Microsoft never published a pass rate for AI-900, and now never will

== nic-cosmetology-practical
   pay : $35,420 median for hairdressers, hairstylists and cosmetologists (BLS, May 2024)
   pass: NIC publishes no national pass rate — and some states no longer require a practical at all

== microsoft-ai-901
   pay : No SOC code exists for "AI fundamentals" — the honest anchor is the IT occupations group at $105,990 (BLS, May 2024)
   pass: No published pass rate — and for AI-901 specifically, nobody has one yet
